      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَبَالَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Fleshiness,</i> (A'Obeyd, S, M, K,) and some
add <i>and fatness.</i> (TA. [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَبَالٌ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بئْرٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَاتُ رَبَالَةٍ</span> <i>A well of which the water is wholesome
and fattening to the drinkers.</i> (Ham p. 367.)

